  "historyNote": "#5925, INTERIM, eff 11-21-94; ss by #6010, eff 3-25-95; ss by #6778, eff 6-26-98; ss by #8664, INTERIM, eff 6-24-06, EXPIRED: 12-21-06 New. #8873, eff 4-24-07; ss by #9395, eff 2-25-09; ss by #10298, eff 3-22-13; ss by #10996, eff 12-19-15; ss by #12753, eff 4-4-19; amd by #13012, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 3-27-20, EXPIRED: 9-23-20 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Nur 300); ss by #14295, eff 8-25-25, EXPIRES: 8-25-35",
